{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：研究主题与行业变化观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">7月第三周起国内民航旅客量出现反弹，但票价并未同步回暖。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在最新中国航空业报告中下调了全行业FY26E盈利预测，认为暑期后半段的量增尚不足以确认行业<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>。报告测算三大航FY26E平均净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40亿元</span>人民币，而彭博一致预期仅约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15亿元</span><span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>，意味着市场盈利预期仍有<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">下修</span>空间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份覆盖三大航及春秋航空的行业更新，核心矛盾在于“量升价跌”与燃油成本高企的叠加。7月国内宏观环境舱裸票价（不含燃油附加费）同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，燃油附加费从10元升至40元，掩盖了基础票价的仍在调整。与此同时，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>大宗商品团队预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>布伦特原油均价为85美元/桶，航油价格仍较冲突前水平高出约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">65%</span>，而燃油附加费的传导能力有限——更高的含税票价会抑制需求，并<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>价格敏感型旅客转向高铁。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWa4V91jI5CWchZQibSjja6fVj5J8dKFq2ERTdBLkRicQpAq9wDdbviaicCpBMOSodpic1qiaESkEPSfS1c6lrSY3KnxnicU7r7KpCYv8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1.7月旅客量业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">FlightMaster数据显示，7月民航客运航班量达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">53.1万</span>架次，日均超<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.71万</span>架次，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，较7月上半月日均航班量同比下降约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>有明显<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。旅客量约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7400万</span>人次，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。但复苏并不均衡：国内及地区航班量同比增长1%，国际航班量仍同比下降2%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分航司看，国航航班量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，南航增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，东航下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>。这组运营数据支撑了报告对国航相对<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>的判断。7月下半月国内旅客量同比增速超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，跨境旅客量增速超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，但报告强调，仍需更多高频数据才能确认<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">复苏</span>的可持续性。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 航班量转正与票价下滑同时出现，说明暑运需求恢复更多来自价格敏感型旅客的边际回流，而非商务出行或高收益客源的实质<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。裸票价同比降幅是观察行业真实定价能力的关键指标，燃油附加费上调只是账面数字的平移。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUgc2sZHMYDdfGWmSMpBuT024jnzFBLT2WZmpzY7qR2A2yvmKdqxFYAnO6ToGv6DpoibD2wJw6icJx0icbTkkrV3xOrkpxYA1jMyw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.三大航业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">三大航2Q26合计净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>预计约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">129亿元</span>，为过去三年同期最差水平。国航2Q26净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41亿元</span>，较2Q25的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2亿元</span>盈利明显出现变化；东航净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37亿元</span>，同比扩大756%；南航净亏损52亿元，同比扩大562%。1H26三大航平均净亏损约27亿元，其中国航24亿元、东航21亿元、南航37亿元，同比分别出现变化30%、19%和143%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告认为，高油价与基础票价仍在调整是<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>扩大的主因，即使行业维持运力纪律，盈利修复仍然脆弱。国航凭借<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>的国泰航空股权回报表现，预计FY26E净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33亿元</span>，为三大航中最低；东航与南航FY26E平均净<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45亿元</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWudChDgYeVILFXjJUeolVgubohuMCjWdjtPkAcm7y8W78yaFPck6w29SsbaUj2ShJSgkzsxbvxZuX0UxST8JwQEYaS6tgmQYA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">2Q26行业客座率仍高于历史同期，但同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>幅度逐月收窄：4月提升2个百分点，5月收窄至1个百分点，6月持平。三大航内部，国航表现明显领先——4至6月国内客座率同比分别提升2、2、1个百分点，国际客座率同比提升9、6、7个百分点；东航国内客座率从+1个百分点转弱至-2个百分点；南航国内外客座率连续三个月同比下滑。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">RPK数据同样呈现分化。6月国航国内RPK同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>，与东航持平，好于南航的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>；</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV8qYkCjuoW1NpA1uvSqCP9Q0E4yIaIbYyOJHCtJeibm5VlH7ZxJibc6Vic9dRlo4cFXt4223CbbYpDq3pkBTwcvLnPBwDIjbFRxs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 69-JPM-Chinese Airlines Waiting for a real demand recovery- summer travel 1H review and earnings cuts-260804</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
